   "briefTitle": "Effects of a 9-months Treatment of SPIRIVA on Health Related Quality of Life in Patients With COPD",
   "officialTitle": "Effect of a 9-month Treatment of SPIRIVA® on Health Related Quality of Life in Patients With Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease. Validation of a New HRQoL Questionnaire Appropriate to Common Daily Practice. (TIPHON Study)"
